I built the sprint board in `src/App.tsx` as a single file, with state kept in a reducer and no react-query. `./check` passes, and all 26 visible tests pass on `./test` (2 of 15 runs used). Two things I was unsure about: the browser console logs a 404 on load (probably a favicon request, which I did not chase), and I disabled the add-card and add-item buttons while their column or checklist is still loading, since the brief does not say what should happen then.